{"id":62936,"mal_id":62936,"title":"Toumei na Yoru ni Kakeru Kimi to, Me ni Mienai Koi wo Shita.","englishTitle":"Love Unseen Beneath the Clear Night Sky","title_english":"Love Unseen Beneath the Clear Night Sky","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Toumei na Yoru ni Kakeru Kimi to, Me ni Mienai Koi wo Shita.","Gokusai no Yoru ni Kakeru-kun to, Menimienai Koi wo Shita.","KakeKoi","I Fell in Love with You, Who Ran Through the Transparent Night, A Love that was Invisible"],"en":"Love Unseen Beneath the Clear Night Sky","ja":"透明な夜に駆ける君と、目に見えない恋をした。"},"synopsis":"Koharu Fuyutsuki is a university student who refuses to let her blindness define her life. Her infectious optimism soon draws the attention of the withdrawn Kakeru Sorano, whose guarded outlook on the world slowly begins to change after meeting her.\n\nAs their bond deepens, the two navigate the everyday challenges that accompany Koharu's condition, discovering that genuine understanding comes not from seeing with one's eyes, but from learning to see another person's heart.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Koharu Fuyutsuki es una estudiante universitaria que se niega a que su ceguera defina su vida. Su contagioso optimismo pronto llama la atención del retraído Kakeru Sorano, cuya cautelosa visión del mundo comienza a cambiar lentamente después de conocerla.\n\nA medida que su vínculo se profundiza, los dos navegan por los desafíos cotidianos que acompañan a la condición de Koharu y descubren que la comprensión genuina no proviene de ver con los ojos, sino de aprender a ver el corazón de otra persona.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1440,"average_episode_duration":1440,"startDate":"2026-07-06","start_date":"2026-07-06","endDate":"2026-09-21","end_date":"2026-09-21","season":"summer","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"summer"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":8.43,"mean":8.43,"numListUsers":120617